                <a href="index.html" class="back-link"><i class="fa fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Main Menu</a>
        <h3><i class="fa fa-apple-whole"></i> Pomodoro Timer</h3>
        <div class="pomodoro-section">
          <div class="pomodoro-controls mb-2">
            <label>Work (min): <input type="number" id="workLength" min="1" max="60" value="25" class="form-control" style="width:70px;display:inline-block;"></label>
            <label>Break (min): <input type="number" id="breakLength" min="1" max="30" value="5" class="form-control" style="width:70px;display:inline-block;"></label>
          </div>
          <div class="pomodoro-status" id="pomodoroStatus">Ready</div>
          <div class="pomodoro-display" id="pomodoroDisplay">25:00</div>
          <div class="pomodoro-btns">
            <button id="startBtn" class="btn btn-success btn-sm"><i class="fa fa-play"></i> Start</button>
            <button id="pauseBtn" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm"><i class="fa fa-pause"></i> Pause</button>
            <button id="resetBtn" class="btn btn-danger btn-sm"><i class="fa fa-refresh"></i> Reset</button>
          </div>
          <div id="pomodoroCycle" style="margin-top:1em;font-size:1em;color:#185a9d;"></div>
        </div>
        <details class="faq-section">
          <summary>FAQs</summary>
          <ul style="padding-left: 1em;">
            <li><b>What is Pomodoro?</b> A productivity technique using timed focus/break cycles.</li>
            <li><b>Can I adjust the timer?</b> Yes, set durations to fit your workflow.</li>
            <li><b>Does this save sessions?</b> No, sessions reset after page reload.</li>
          </ul>
