          <ul>
            <li><b>Donâ€™t skip breaks:</b> Regular rests keep you energized.</li>
            <li><b>Track sessions:</b> See how many Pomodoros you complete daily.</li>
            <li><b>Customize lengths:</b> Adjust timer for tasks that suit you.</li>
